+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-specialtydirectory-001"></a>
+
+Staff also ask the directory the inverse question: which veterinarians hold a given specialty. A second page answers it. It lists every specialty the clinic knows, under the name the clinic stores, and names the veterinarians holding each one `[REQ-SPECIALTYDIRECTORY-001]` (confirmed 2026-08-21). Each veterinarian is named in full, first name then last name. A veterinarian holding no specialty is named nowhere on it, because the page lists specialties rather than the clinic's roster. Every specialty appears at once, without paging.
